#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:16
msgid "Automatic light and dark switching"
msgstr "Athrú uathoibríoch éadrom agus dorcha"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:17
msgid ""
"Switch the light/dark style at sunrise and sunset (sun), at light-time and "
"dark-time (custom), or never (off). Runs in the background monitor."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh an stíl éadrom/dorcha ag éirí agus ag luí na gréine (an ghrian), ag "
"am an tsolais agus ag am dorcha (gnáth), nó ná bíodh (scoth). Ritheann sa "
"mhonatóir cúlra."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:22
msgid "Light style time"
msgstr "Am stíl éadrom"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:23
msgid ""
"Minutes after midnight when the custom schedule switches to the light style."
msgstr ""
"Nóiméad tar éis meán oíche nuair a athraíonn an sceideal saincheaptha go dtí "
"an stíl éadrom."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:28
msgid "Dark style time"
msgstr "Am stíl dorcha"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:29
msgid ""
"Minutes after midnight when the custom schedule switches to the dark style."
msgstr ""
"Nóiméad tar éis meán oíche nuair a athraíonn an sceideal saincheaptha go dtí "
"an stíl dorcha."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:33
msgid "Last known location"
msgstr "An suíomh is déanaí ar eolas"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:34
msgid ""
"Latitude and longitude from GeoClue, used for sunrise and sunset. Out of "
"range values mean none is known, and the system time zone gives the location."
msgstr ""
"Domhanleithead agus domhanfhad ó GeoClue, a úsáidtear le haghaidh éirí "
"gréine agus luí na gréine. Ciallaíonn luachanna as raon nach bhfuil aon "
"eolas ar fáil, agus tugann crios ama an chórais an suíomh."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:4
msgid "Switchcraft"
msgstr "Switchcraft"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:6
#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Arnis Kemlers"
msgstr "Arnis Kemlers"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Automate light and dark theme switching"
msgstr "Uathoibrigh an t-athrú idir téama éadrom agus dorcha"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Switchcraft follows the light and dark style of GNOME and KDE Plasma. On "
"every switch it runs your shell commands and applies per-theme settings such "
"as the wallpaper, icon, GTK and Kvantum themes. Applications that do not "
"follow the system style stay in sync."
msgstr ""
"Leanann Switchcraft stíl éadrom agus dorcha GNOME agus KDE Plasma. Ag gach "
"athrú, ritheann sé d’orduithe sliogáin agus cuireann sé socruithe de réir "
"téama i bhfeidhm, mar shampla an cúlbhrat agus téamaí deilbhíní, GTK agus "
"Kvantum. Ar an gcaoi sin, fanann feidhmchláir nach leanann stíl an chórais i "
"gcomhréir."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"It can also switch the style for you at sunset and sunrise or at custom "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an stíl a athrú duit freisin ag luí na gréine agus ag éirí na "
"gréine nó ag amanna saincheaptha."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:41
msgid ""
"Built-in commands: pick a setting and a value from a list instead of typing "
"a command"
msgstr ""
"Orduithe ionsuite: roghnaigh socrú agus luach as liosta in ionad ordú a "
"chlóscríobh"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid "KDE Plasma and Kvantum support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do KDE Plasma agus Kvantum"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid "Automatic switching at sunset and sunrise or at custom times"
msgstr ""
"Athrú uathoibríoch ag luí na gréine agus ag éirí na gréine nó ag amanna "
"saincheaptha"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:44
msgid ""
"Redesigned command list with drag-and-drop reordering, command testing and "
"undo"
msgstr ""
"Liosta orduithe athdheartha le hathordú trí tharraingt agus scaoileadh, "
"tástáil orduithe agus cealú"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:45
msgid "Translated into 22 languages"
msgstr "Aistrithe go 22 teanga"

